{"html": "<div class=\"tpcard\"><div class=\"tph\">📌 注目開示トピックス（株価に効きやすい適時開示）</div><a class=\"tprow\" href=\"https://webapi.yanoshin.jp/rd.php?https://www.release.tdnet.info/inbs/140120261029558828.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tpbadge tneg\">上場廃止・監理</span><span class=\"num\">10/30</span> 上場廃止となった子会社（九州電力株式会社）に関する決算開示について <span class=\"pdf\">PDF ›</span></a><div class=\"tpnote\">見出しの機械判定です。内容の良し悪し・織り込み済みかどうかは開示原文でご確認ください。採点には含めていません。</div></div><div class=\"nhead\">いまの指標の位置（主要7＋準主要7指標）</div><div class=\"mlegend\"><span style=\"background:#b9dcc0\">安心・標準</span><span style=\"background:#c9dcf3\">魅力あり（要確認）</span><span style=\"background:#f5e6b3\">注意</span><span style=\"background:#f2c4a8\">警戒</span><span style=\"background:#eeeae0\">中立</span></div><div class=\"meters\"><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">RSI(14)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:30.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:48.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">48</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ボリンジャー</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:16.7%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:16.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:83.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:19.5%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">-1.8σ</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">25日線乖離</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:25.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:25.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:55.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:75.0%; width:25.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:66.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">-3.3%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MACD</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:16.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">下向き</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">50/200日線</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:75.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">GC</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">支持帯の試し</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:60.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">5回目</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">20日高値から</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:13.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:53.3%; width:46.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:70.2%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">−10.5%</span></div><div class=\"msub\">準主要指標（補助的に見る）</div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ストキャス</s